1
00:00:30,072 --> 00:00:32,241
Wh-What the--?

2
00:00:32,241 --> 00:00:33,742
What was that?

3
00:00:33,742 --> 00:00:35,452
Thunder?

4
00:00:37,412 --> 00:00:39,122
A Thunder Spear.

5
00:00:40,290 --> 00:00:42,292
But why?

6
00:00:46,213 --> 00:00:48,841
Let's head in that direction.

7
00:01:08,110 --> 00:01:12,197
It's so... quiet.

8
00:01:13,699 --> 00:01:17,119
Am I... dying?

9
00:03:20,075 --> 00:03:25,080
"Above and Below"

10
00:03:31,920 --> 00:03:37,259
"We'll dine at the same table again soon."

11
00:03:37,259 --> 00:03:42,556
Hasn't it happened just like I said,
Commander Pyxis?

12
00:03:42,556 --> 00:03:45,309
I appreciate your swift response.

13
00:03:45,309 --> 00:03:53,817
You gathered all soldiers in Shiganshina
and forbade opposition like we asked.

14
00:03:53,817 --> 00:03:58,405
Given the spinal fluid,
we didn't have much choice.

15
00:03:58,405 --> 00:04:05,996
Only Shiganshina was evacuated,
and we could become Titans at any minute.

16
00:04:05,996 --> 00:04:13,003
In any case, what else could I do with
comrades pointing guns at my back?

17
00:04:13,003 --> 00:04:19,760
I'm sorry, Commander.
My son and I both drank the wine.

18
00:04:19,760 --> 00:04:21,261
Since when did you betray--?

19
00:04:21,261 --> 00:04:24,097
There's no need to answer.

20
00:04:25,098 --> 00:04:26,767
Forgive me.

21
00:04:26,767 --> 00:04:32,481
It seems switching sides sooner
came with advantages.

22
00:04:32,481 --> 00:04:38,987
That white armband you wear so proudly
is proof you're a Jaegerist, no?

23
00:04:38,987 --> 00:04:46,870
Red must be for those who learned they drank
tainted wine and were forced to comply.

24
00:04:46,870 --> 00:04:55,254
The rest of us fools who drank the wine without
knowing a thing are identified with black.

25
00:04:55,254 --> 00:04:58,423
Sounds like how Marley does things.

26
00:04:58,423 --> 00:05:03,929
Didn't they do something similar
when they took over your homelands?

27
00:05:03,929 --> 00:05:06,515
We can learn a lot from our enemies.

28
00:05:06,515 --> 00:05:09,226
Such as how to make more of them.

29
00:05:09,226 --> 00:05:13,897
Was it not your people who
refused to side with us?

30
00:05:13,897 --> 00:05:20,028
That said, considering we failed to trust
guests who served us tainted wine,

31
00:05:20,028 --> 00:05:24,449
does that make us foolish or wise?

32
00:05:24,449 --> 00:05:27,619
You were both foolish and wise.

33
00:05:27,619 --> 00:05:34,543
If you had trusted Zeke and us from the start,
the world might be saved by now.

34
00:05:34,543 --> 00:05:35,919
Hmm?

35
00:05:37,462 --> 00:05:40,257
"The world might be saved"?

36
00:05:40,257 --> 00:05:44,636
I was under the impression your plan
was to reunite Zeke and Eren

37
00:05:44,636 --> 00:05:52,019
for a small-scale rumbling to keep other
nations at bay for the next 50 years.

38
00:05:52,019 --> 00:05:55,397
Won't only the island be saved?

39
00:05:58,192 --> 00:05:59,318
Yelena?

40
00:05:59,318 --> 00:06:04,990
It's too late. Zeke gave you plenty of time.

41
00:06:04,990 --> 00:06:09,953
And you answered his mercy
by planning to kill him.

42
00:06:09,953 --> 00:06:15,626
Zeke is the god who will save the world
and you've earned his wrath.

43
00:06:17,294 --> 00:06:23,634
So? All we can do is sit here
while it all plays out?

44
00:06:23,634 --> 00:06:25,594
Care for tea?

45
00:06:25,594 --> 00:06:26,887
Thanks.

46
00:06:26,887 --> 00:06:31,642
Armin, could you bust out
of here as a Titan?

47
00:06:32,684 --> 00:06:36,522
No. I'd just destroy the city.

48
00:06:36,522 --> 00:06:42,569
Unlike Eren's Titan, the Colossal Titan
can't do something that precise.

49
00:06:45,656 --> 00:06:52,913
So? Why did Eren beat you to a pulp?
It's about time you tell us.

50
00:06:54,748 --> 00:06:58,085
He said hurtful things to Mikasa.

51
00:06:58,085 --> 00:07:01,547
I swung at him and he hit back.

52
00:07:01,547 --> 00:07:02,422
Huh?

53
00:07:02,422 --> 00:07:05,551
He hurt Mikasa? How?

54
00:07:05,551 --> 00:07:08,011
--Well--
--Stop.

55
00:07:08,011 --> 00:07:09,429
It's fine.

56
00:07:09,429 --> 00:07:13,267
No, it's not. What exactly did he say?

57
00:07:13,267 --> 00:07:19,773
Forget it, Jean. We already
know he's a total piece of shit.

58
00:07:19,773 --> 00:07:26,446
Now he's lost his mind and hurt the
two people he should care about most.

59
00:07:26,446 --> 00:07:31,869
I think if he was sane,
he wouldn't do it without a good reason.

60
00:07:31,869 --> 00:07:36,039
Do you think there's some sort
of meaning behind it?

61
00:07:38,625 --> 00:07:42,838
Long time no see, heroes of Shiganshina.

62
00:07:42,838 --> 00:07:47,426
It pains me to reunite in a place like this.

63
00:07:47,426 --> 00:07:51,972
Hey! You're on their side, too?! Let us out!

64
00:07:51,972 --> 00:07:57,895
That's a lot to ask, considering
you guys put me on house arrest.

65
00:07:57,895 --> 00:08:02,524
Just sit quiet and behave
until Zeke and Eren meet.

66
00:08:02,524 --> 00:08:03,859
You...!

67
00:08:03,859 --> 00:08:06,612
Must be nice, Yelena.

68
00:08:06,612 --> 00:08:09,948
Everything went exactly how you planned.

69
00:08:09,948 --> 00:08:13,452
Through you, Eren moved how Zeke wanted.

70
00:08:13,452 --> 00:08:21,835
Raiding Marley, getting people's support,
using wine to take over the military...

71
00:08:21,835 --> 00:08:25,464
Now, Eldia and the Founding Titan are yours.

72
00:08:25,464 --> 00:08:28,967
You can crush Marley
and avenge your homelands.

73
00:08:28,967 --> 00:08:33,180
Isn't that the real reason
you came to the island?

74
00:08:33,180 --> 00:08:37,893
This place was primitive.
We brought it out of the past.

75
00:08:37,893 --> 00:08:38,769
Eh?!

76
00:08:38,769 --> 00:08:44,733
So you and your pals could enjoy it.
Once you ruled, that is.

77
00:08:44,733 --> 00:08:48,278
You were tricked and lost. That's all it is.

78
00:08:48,278 --> 00:08:55,577
Greiz! Looks like you sold us out to get
promoted to Yelena's lackey, you snitch!

79
00:08:55,577 --> 00:08:57,746
Are you dumb?

80
00:08:57,746 --> 00:09:01,792
It's you who sided with
the devils and betrayed us!

81
00:09:01,792 --> 00:09:02,793
What?

82
00:09:02,793 --> 00:09:07,965
You had the hots for some devil spawn
who reeked of potatoes!

83
00:09:08,924 --> 00:09:10,092
I'm gonna kill you!

84
00:09:10,092 --> 00:09:11,385
Chill, Nicolo!

85
00:09:11,385 --> 00:09:14,888
You wouldn't shut up about her, day and night.

86
00:09:14,888 --> 00:09:18,767
Stupid me thought you'd
get a grip when the bitch died.

87
00:09:18,767 --> 00:09:20,310
What'd you say?!

88
00:09:20,310 --> 00:09:25,190
I'll make it easy to understand.
That spawn-of-the-devil whore was--

89
00:09:28,610 --> 00:09:30,237
Yelena?!

90
00:09:30,237 --> 00:09:32,990
I apologize for his disrespect.

91
00:09:32,990 --> 00:09:38,287
This island has no need for
those who would call you devils.

92
00:09:38,287 --> 00:09:46,044
Believe me, our true goal is nothing
as hollow as getting revenge on Marley.

93
00:09:46,044 --> 00:09:53,135
Our goal is to end the cycle of hatred
to save Eldia and even Marley.

94
00:09:53,135 --> 00:09:56,555
No more secrets. I'll tell you everything--

95
00:09:56,555 --> 00:10:01,894
about Zeke's plan to save the world:
His "euthanization" plan.

96
00:10:06,023 --> 00:10:10,861
They're devils, though. So, why am I...?

97
00:10:14,364 --> 00:10:17,534
Hey, brat who killed Sasha.

98
00:10:18,660 --> 00:10:20,037
What do you want?

99
00:10:20,037 --> 00:10:23,290
If you wanna save Falco, help me.

100
00:10:26,168 --> 00:10:30,631
Help... you? How?

101
00:10:30,631 --> 00:10:36,929
Call for help on the radio to
flush out intruders in the walls.

102
00:10:38,055 --> 00:10:41,558
Don't move. Keep quiet, Gabi.

103
00:10:43,769 --> 00:10:46,104
--Pieck!
--Quiet.

104
00:10:47,022 --> 00:10:53,070
I take it you're Eren Jaeger, correct?

105
00:10:53,070 --> 00:10:58,075
"Shiganshina District, where the Operation to
Retake the Founding Titan began. The operation
failed and the hole in the wall was plugged.
The current state of the district is unknown."

106
00:11:00,452 --> 00:11:04,248
Gabi, aim the rifle at Eren.

107
00:11:06,792 --> 00:11:08,168
Gabi!

108
00:11:12,673 --> 00:11:16,134
Eren, hands out of your pockets.

109
00:11:16,134 --> 00:11:18,387
And what if I refuse?

110
00:11:18,387 --> 00:11:22,808
I pull the trigger and
your brains hit the floor.

111
00:11:22,808 --> 00:11:26,144
Ever seen it? No time to transform.

112
00:11:26,144 --> 00:11:32,818
And? Why don't you pull it?
If not, why else are you here?

113
00:11:32,818 --> 00:11:35,112
What happens if I don't listen?

114
00:11:35,112 --> 00:11:39,157
That's something you'll never know.
Once your brains hit--

115
00:11:39,157 --> 00:11:42,286
I do know. You won't shoot.

116
00:11:42,286 --> 00:11:46,331
You aren't allowed to kill the Founding Titan.

117
00:11:46,331 --> 00:11:49,960
Your orders are just to retake it.

118
00:11:49,960 --> 00:11:56,758
But for that, you'll have to turn into
a Titan and eat me alive, right?

119
00:11:56,758 --> 00:11:58,218
Pieck!

120
00:11:59,845 --> 00:12:03,807
Gabi, take your finger off the trigger.

121
00:12:03,807 --> 00:12:08,353
You're not the only one who
would pay for defying the military.

122
00:12:08,353 --> 00:12:11,273
Your family in the zone would, too.

123
00:12:14,318 --> 00:12:21,700
Yeah, I won't shoot. And eating you
doesn't seem possible either, so...

124
00:12:21,700 --> 00:12:23,285
Pieck?

125
00:12:23,285 --> 00:12:28,081
You found my Titan footprints
from when I invaded, right?

126
00:12:28,081 --> 00:12:34,838
I thought I did well sneaking
into your midst without being caught.

127
00:12:34,838 --> 00:12:38,050
But I have other reasons for not shooting.

128
00:12:38,050 --> 00:12:43,722
If you used the Founding Titan's power,
couldn't you defeat Marley?

129
00:12:45,849 --> 00:12:51,021
You wouldn't make the world your
enemy unless you knew you could win.

130
00:12:51,021 --> 00:12:55,150
Do you have something more
than the Founding Titan?

131
00:12:55,150 --> 00:12:57,653
Pieck, what are you...?

132
00:12:57,653 --> 00:13:01,365
Gabi, put down the rifle.

133
00:13:01,365 --> 00:13:04,368
Supposing I did, what's your goal?

134
00:13:04,368 --> 00:13:09,581
To free all Eldians in Marley
and around the world.

135
00:13:09,581 --> 00:13:14,503
I want to free my family
in the internment zone.

136
00:13:14,503 --> 00:13:21,093
I became a Warrior to get my dad,
my only family, proper medical care.

137
00:13:21,093 --> 00:13:28,058
He survived, but he's incredibly sad
knowing my term will soon be over.

138
00:13:28,058 --> 00:13:35,482
Before I die and leave him behind, I want
to show him Eldia has a bright future.

139
00:13:35,482 --> 00:13:42,155
For that, Marley needs to be crushed.
I'll help however I can.

140
00:13:42,155 --> 00:13:46,785
If we can slaughter Marley,
I'll do whatever it takes.

141
00:13:51,665 --> 00:13:57,087
The mastermind of the attack
on Marley... was Zeke.

142
00:13:57,087 --> 00:14:02,092
Now, you? What have we been fighting for?!

143
00:14:02,092 --> 00:14:09,933
Once the world knows that we're good
Eldians, won't they let us go free?!

144
00:14:09,933 --> 00:14:13,312
You're the same as Zeke--a traitor!

145
00:14:13,312 --> 00:14:14,730
Gabi.

146
00:14:15,898 --> 00:14:22,571
Are we Marleyans or are we Eldians?
What do you think?

147
00:14:22,571 --> 00:14:25,824
We're... Honorary Marleyans.

148
00:14:25,824 --> 00:14:32,998
Wrong. We are Subjects of Ymir.
That's the one truth we can't escape.

149
00:14:32,998 --> 00:14:38,170
No matter what we're called,
we're a race that turns into Titans.

150
00:14:38,170 --> 00:14:43,342
But like we saw at Fort Slava,
Titan power is on its way out.

151
00:14:43,342 --> 00:14:49,598
As soon as Marley can't use us,
they'll slaughter us all.

152
00:14:49,598 --> 00:14:55,938
Even if we prove we're "good Eldians,"
there's zero chance that we're freed.

153
00:14:55,938 --> 00:15:00,859
We have to secure our right
to live with our own hands.

154
00:15:02,194 --> 00:15:09,910
Prove it. If you're going to cooperate
with us, show us you mean it.

155
00:15:09,910 --> 00:15:12,746
I'll show you where my comrades are.

156
00:15:12,746 --> 00:15:13,497
Wha--?!

157
00:15:13,497 --> 00:15:14,748
How?

158
00:15:14,748 --> 00:15:19,211
If we go to the roof,
I can point out where they are.

159
00:15:21,088 --> 00:15:23,298
Fine.

160
00:15:23,298 --> 00:15:26,134
Stop children from being born?

161
00:15:26,134 --> 00:15:30,514
Correct. That's Zeke's euthanization plan.

162
00:15:30,514 --> 00:15:36,812
All suffering brought about by Titans
will disappear from the world.

163
00:15:36,812 --> 00:15:39,481
Gradually. Peacefully.

164
00:15:39,481 --> 00:15:42,401
Wait. How is that peaceful?

165
00:15:42,401 --> 00:15:49,157
If Subjects of Ymir slowly die out,
we'll only have geezers to defend in the end.

166
00:15:49,157 --> 00:15:53,579
How do we protect ourselves?
You think they'll leave us alone?

167
00:15:53,579 --> 00:15:58,625
The rumbling can serve as a deterrent
as long as the Founding Titan

168
00:15:58,625 --> 00:16:02,212
and the royal bloodline are preserved.

169
00:16:02,212 --> 00:16:06,592
Fortunately, Queen Historia
was blessed with an heir.

170
00:16:06,592 --> 00:16:12,764
As long as Subjects of Ymir inherit the
Founder until her child passes away...

171
00:16:12,764 --> 00:16:16,435
You talk like this is a sure thing.

172
00:16:16,435 --> 00:16:21,732
Sure things... Certainties...
No nation can claim to have them.

173
00:16:21,732 --> 00:16:25,903
Each one has its own share of problems.

174
00:16:25,903 --> 00:16:30,782
But there is one certainty,
and that's the threat of Titans.

175
00:16:30,782 --> 00:16:38,290
Their history of tears and bloodshed
will be put to an end... by Zeke and Eren.

176
00:16:38,290 --> 00:16:41,793
I don't know how long humanity will last,

177
00:16:41,793 --> 00:16:46,924
but it's hard to think that a greater
feat will ever come to pass.

178
00:16:46,924 --> 00:16:53,013
People will speak of the brothers
as legends for millennia to come.

179
00:16:53,013 --> 00:16:56,141
Like the gods of the past.

180
00:16:56,141 --> 00:17:01,980
Even after their deaths, they'll be seen
as saviors who shone over humanity.

181
00:17:05,484 --> 00:17:06,944
Something wrong?

182
00:17:06,944 --> 00:17:12,282
No... But to think your cause was so noble...

183
00:17:13,200 --> 00:17:16,995
It touched my heart!

184
00:17:16,995 --> 00:17:19,706
That's wonderful.

185
00:17:19,706 --> 00:17:23,001
I'm glad to know you understand.

186
00:17:23,001 --> 00:17:24,837
Yelena!

187
00:17:24,837 --> 00:17:28,006
Come quick! Invaders!

188
00:17:28,006 --> 00:17:30,551
--The enemy's here!
--Someone was killed!

189
00:17:30,551 --> 00:17:32,386
It's the Cart Titan!

190
00:17:32,386 --> 00:17:35,347
--What?!
--Did she betray Marley?

191
00:17:35,347 --> 00:17:37,266
That's what Jaeger said.

192
00:17:37,266 --> 00:17:40,602
Hmm? What's all the ruckus about?

193
00:17:42,563 --> 00:17:47,025
Is it safe to say you and I are allies now?

194
00:17:47,025 --> 00:17:50,737
If you can point out the other invaders.

195
00:17:50,737 --> 00:17:54,032
Until then, you'll be cuffed to the Marley kid.

196
00:17:54,032 --> 00:17:59,121
If you try to transform, she'll bite the dust.

197
00:17:59,121 --> 00:18:04,042
Don't worry. This kid will
come around soon enough.

198
00:18:05,544 --> 00:18:07,212
--That bitty thing is a Marley soldier?

199
00:18:07,212 --> 00:18:09,464
--She's an ally?
--That bitty thing is a Marley soldier?

200
00:18:09,464 --> 00:18:11,717
Hi there!

201
00:18:16,471 --> 00:18:20,684
Hey... Where is Falco?

202
00:18:20,684 --> 00:18:27,941
Falco's here, too. But it seems he
drank some of Zeke's spinal fluid.

203
00:18:27,941 --> 00:18:29,276
How?

204
00:18:29,276 --> 00:18:36,116
Who knows? They're saying the wine
with spinal fluid got in his mouth.

205
00:18:36,116 --> 00:18:39,286
--Is that when...?
--Gabi?

206
00:18:39,286 --> 00:18:43,707
It's my fault... again.

207
00:18:43,707 --> 00:18:49,213
I see. You took over the military
with Zeke's spinal fluid.

208
00:18:49,213 --> 00:18:53,842
Do you know why Zeke
even has an ability like that?

209
00:18:53,842 --> 00:18:58,013
Beats me. Do you know?

210
00:18:58,013 --> 00:19:02,976
No. Other than Zeke himself, nobody does.

211
00:19:04,853 --> 00:19:10,943
Ever since I met him, I felt like
Zeke was telling lie after lie.

212
00:19:10,943 --> 00:19:14,446
Four years ago, I confirmed that hunch.

213
00:19:14,446 --> 00:19:19,326
Only with you did his words seem true.

214
00:19:19,326 --> 00:19:24,331
"Believe me, I know what you're
going through, Eren.

215
00:19:24,331 --> 00:19:28,085
Someday, I'm coming back to rescue you."

216
00:19:29,378 --> 00:19:34,341
If anyone, I thought he'd tell you
about his secret power.

217
00:19:34,341 --> 00:19:40,889
For example, like it can draw out the
Founding Titan's power or something.

218
00:19:45,936 --> 00:19:51,984
Oh? You shaved your beard?
I thought it suited you.

219
00:19:55,779 --> 00:20:00,826
Eren, it's not safe to trust that woman.

220
00:20:00,826 --> 00:20:05,622
Yeah. I don't trust her,
either, but it's mutual.

221
00:20:11,545 --> 00:20:17,759
By the way, aren't you using the
Founding Titan's power? Where's Zeke?

222
00:20:17,759 --> 00:20:20,095
You'll find out soon enough.

223
00:20:21,763 --> 00:20:25,601
Show me. Where is the enemy?

224
00:20:42,242 --> 00:20:43,911
There.

225
00:21:18,737 --> 00:21:20,155
What the--?!

226
00:21:21,156 --> 00:21:23,867
It's begun.

227
00:21:23,867 --> 00:21:27,913
The Titans... have started to move.

228
00:21:31,416 --> 00:21:33,669
Galliard!

229
00:21:33,669 --> 00:21:36,255
I knew it wouldn't be easy.

230
00:21:36,255 --> 00:21:39,007
Pieck! You're not a traitor?!

231
00:21:39,007 --> 00:21:42,261
Gabi! You thought I'd sell out my comrades?

232
00:21:42,261 --> 00:21:46,265
But you said we have no future
fighting for Marley!

233
00:21:46,265 --> 00:21:47,641
Look.

234
00:21:51,228 --> 00:21:54,398
I don't trust Marley.

235
00:21:54,398 --> 00:21:59,236
But I do trust the comrades
I've fought alongside.

236
00:22:02,364 --> 00:22:04,575
There's the smoke signal.

237
00:22:04,575 --> 00:22:08,829
Pieck and Galliard have exposed his location.

238
00:22:08,829 --> 00:22:11,081
It's the Founding Titan.

239
00:22:13,417 --> 00:22:16,086
Go get revenge for Liberio!

240
00:22:16,086 --> 00:22:18,881
Let's put an end to this guy.

241
00:22:22,843 --> 00:22:24,595
Bring it on...

242
00:22:27,639 --> 00:24:02,070
...Reiner!
